WhereHurt

This repository includes or references third-party anatomy assets from
Anatria-3D:
https://github.com/Nurkan1/Anatria-3D/tree/main/public/anatomy

The upstream project identifies the anatomy data as derived from Z-Anatomy /
BodyParts3D and distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International license (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The anatomy assets are separate from the original WhereHurt source code. Their
license and attribution requirements continue to apply. Refer to the upstream
project for the complete attribution chain and source terms.

muscle-optimized.glb and muscle-mobile.glb are modified derivatives of
nervous_male.glb and muscular_male.glb: muscle-only filtering, missing-muscle
supplementation, decimation and recompression with original part coordinates.
skeleton-mobile.glb is a simplified derivative of skeletal_male.glb.
organs-optimized.glb and organs-mobile.glb derive from visceral_male.glb plus
heart chambers from cardiovascular_male.glb and Spleen from lymphatic_male.glb.
The chambers form one Heart mesh; lobes form one Left lung and one Right lung
mesh. World transforms are baked before joining, then meshes are simplified.
organ-supplement-source.glb contains the extracted original chambers and spleen.

All of these male-atlas assets retain CC BY-SA 4.0 attribution and share-alike
terms. The upstream attribution chain is included in public/anatomy/NOTICE.
Source commit: 6f464dfec563352ea4eebd1219f4866a14e7dbf8.
